{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1436","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Sum Over Subsets"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a multiset $$$S$$$. Over all pairs of subsets $$$A$$$ and $$$B$$$, such that:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$B \\subset A$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$|B| = |A| - 1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" greatest common divisor of all elements in $$$A$$$ is equal to one; "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"find the sum of $$$\\sum_{x \\in A}{x} \\cdot \\sum_{x \\in B}{x}$$$, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$m$$$ ($$$1 \\le m \\le 10^5$$$): the number of different values in the multiset $$$S$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$m$$$ lines contains two integers $$$a_i$$$, $$$freq_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^5, 1 \\le freq_i \\le 10^9$$$). Element $$$a_i$$$ appears in the multiset $$$S$$$ $$$freq_i$$$ times. All $$$a_i$$$ are different."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the required sum, modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n1 1\n2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n1 1\n2 1\n3 1\n6 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1207\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n560\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A multiset is a set where elements are allowed to coincide. $$$|X|$$$ is the cardinality of a set $$$X$$$, the number of elements in it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$A \\subset B$$$: Set $$$A$$$ is a subset of a set $$$B$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example $$$B=\\{1\\}, A=\\{1,2\\}$$$ and $$$B=\\{2\\}, A=\\{1, 2\\}$$$ have a product equal to $$$1\\cdot3 + 2\\cdot3=9$$$. Other pairs of $$$A$$$ and $$$B$$$ don't satisfy the given constraints."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1436F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1436/problem/F"}